  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 20 ÷ 6 + 10 - 5 × 2 = 2.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 5 and 10\n\nGiven: 20 ÷ 6 + 10 - 5 × 2 = 2\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**20 ÷ 6**__ + 5 - 10 × 2 = 2\n\n⇒ 3.33 + 5 - __**10**____** × 2**__ = 2\n\n⇒ __**3.33 + 5**__ - 20 = 2\n\n⇒ __**8.33 - 20**__ = 2\n\n⇒ -11.67 = 2\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 6 and 10\n\nGiven: 20 ÷ 6 + 10 - 5 × 2 = 2\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**20 ÷ 10**__ + 6 - 5 × 2 = 2\n\n⇒ 2 + 6 - __**5 × 2**__ = 2\n\n⇒ __**2 + 6**__ - 10 = 2\n\n⇒ __**8 - 10**__ = 2\n\n⇒ -2 ≠ 2\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 10 and 20 \n\nGiven: 20 ÷ 6 + 10 - 5 × 2 = 2\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**1**____**0 ÷ 6**__ + 20 - 5 × 2 = 2\n\n⇒ 1.66 + 20 - __**5 × 2**__ = 2\n\n⇒ __**1.66 + 2**____**0**__ - 10 = 2\n\n⇒ __**21.66 - 10**__ = 2\n\n⇒ 11.66 ≠ 2\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 5 and 6\n\nGiven: 20 ÷ 6 + 10 - 5 × 2 = 2\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**20 ÷ 5**__ + 10 - 6 × 2 = 2\n\n⇒ 4 + 10 - __**6**____** × 2**__ = 2\n\n⇒ __**4 **____**+ 10**__ - 12 = 2\n\n⇒ __14 - 12__ = 2\n\n⇒ **2 = 2**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
